{"event_type":"review","id":"f9ecf065d21244be7f6d88d09f87379ecd95da4d1b61e343bbaea666bf5d3719","occurred_at":"2026-11-13T11:18:53Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e778b331f63cf36c1524137ede8217703da6f92f9b08719dc3413e8eb95aaac8","sha256":"e778b331f63cf36c1524137ede8217703da6f92f9b08719dc3413e8eb95aaac8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/7ea098d25a4f7f3c887437b6353948634aadb40d0866133d7864dd65f511f317","sha256":"7ea098d25a4f7f3c887437b6353948634aadb40d0866133d7864dd65f511f317"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e799fe3d59505e7c2d8315305b703eae412871375e0e0086c945563e95449b6e","sha256":"e799fe3d59505e7c2d8315305b703eae412871375e0e0086c945563e95449b6e"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a7d4c9ad3ce4d69c92b60aaf81e4e72956e2b5e7a49be7be99bc4e173315a6a8","sha256":"a7d4c9ad3ce4d69c92b60aaf81e4e72956e2b5e7a49be7be99bc4e173315a6a8"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/6ce5eb5dfac0d51cc6bce77ed2e3e262aa1f1ac566236cbeed7de50060c6c3dc","sha256":"6ce5eb5dfac0d51cc6bce77ed2e3e262aa1f1ac566236cbeed7de50060c6c3dc"}],"attempt_id":"ae2032ee673e088b0f763d66a1cf699e9ca0be0e42663f07d4d79b1eed177080:0:1","base":"e4b15b893458ba8bd0cdf4912c030ffd1d07bf42","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"175f26ec785fe268e97446378899e43fe8e7976b","body":"**Normalize relative recovery-record paths.**\n\nWith `--record-dir ../records --record ../records/controller-<id>.json`, `effects.record_dir` is absolute but `path.parent` remains relative. The comparison at `apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py:1421` rejects the correct retained record before recovery can run.\n\nNormalize `path` with `absolute_record_dir()` before the parent and symlink checks. This preserves detection of a symlinked final component.","id":"9cb6db0bcb5554836bc10c4d2e33dfa1a8955bfefffc5ff87406d53f791aa921","intervals":[[1418,1418]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Normalize relative recovery-record paths."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"175f26ec785fe268e97446378899e43fe8e7976b","body":"**Serialize health failures in machine mode.**\n\nIf receipt or run-directory enumeration raises `OSError`, this branch re-raises the error. The outer handler at `apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py:2183-2184` converts it to `SystemExit(str(exc))`. Even with `--json`, stdout is empty and stderr contains the error.\n\nEmit one JSON error artifact before returning the failure code.\n\nAs per coding guidelines, I1 requires “In machine mode (`--json`) stderr stays empty” and stdout remains exactly one JSON artifact.","id":"bbd48e4524598fe413ac009d018b06a2f6d342a31fdd91dfd2e7e14100e1b942","intervals":[[2167,2168]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Serialize health failures in machine mode."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"9d555b1ad56949dcad951c67018594b980da288c","body":"**Use a shell-safe run ID in the reproduction commands.**\n\nThe shell interprets `<run>` as redirection, not as an argument. The `destroy` command has a syntax error, so copying the procedure leaves the VM running. Tell the operator to set a run ID variable and use it in both commands.","id":"c0cb82429346831788fb479bcffaa1642e935699f4e12828c4913d05a4cf9c58","intervals":[[366,369]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/VM-FEASIBILITY.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Use a shell-safe run ID in the reproduction commands."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"9d555b1ad56949dcad951c67018594b980da288c","body":"**Restore each activator’s prior state.**\n\nThe fixture’s timer and path were enabled before fencing, but this instruction also applies to previously disabled or inactive activators. Re-enabling and starting those activators can start work that the operator had intentionally stopped. Require the adapter to restore the captured enablement and active states instead.","id":"43ecd96930d130a9fcbf1a5014001d9a5fdaacd5af24e8b6a798ee9666cb6f78","intervals":[[238,240]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/VM-FEASIBILITY.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Restore each activator’s prior state."}],"head":"b41133fb7e7715bc0853365576e53e9db1aa37a5","head_tree":"40cca612920bd0f60b7d7ded61025db433bf3a2a","input_scope":[{"blob":"9d555b1ad56949dcad951c67018594b980da288c","intervals":[[1,379]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/VM-FEASIBILITY.md"},{"blob":"175f26ec785fe268e97446378899e43fe8e7976b","intervals":[[1,2184]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py"}],"job_id":"ae2032ee673e088b0f763d66a1cf699e9ca0be0e42663f07d4d79b1eed177080:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"9d555b1ad56949dcad951c67018594b980da288c","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/VM-FEASIBILITY.md","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"175f26ec785fe268e97446378899e43fe8e7976b","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"9d555b1ad56949dcad951c67018594b980da288c","intervals":[[70,78],[164,170]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/VM-FEASIBILITY.md"},{"blob":"175f26ec785fe268e97446378899e43fe8e7976b","intervals":[[1994,1995],[2001,2022],[2024,2029],[2041,2043],[2066,2070],[2072,2072],[2152,2153],[2157,2158],[2163,2164],[2174,2175]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/deploy-controller.py"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"9d555b1ad56949dcad9